0020:     - The foreground is split into separated 4-connected objects.
0021:     - Objects of area at most three are stationary markers; larger objects are moving sprites.
0022: 
0023:     Rule:
0024:     - Clear each moving sprite from its original position.
0025:     - Translate each moving sprite vertically downward until its bbox bottom reaches the grid bottom.
0026:     - Repaint each translated sprite in its original color; small markers stay unchanged.
0027: 
0028:     Key insight:
0029:     - Object area separates the active falling sprites from the small fixed markers, and all active sprites follow the same vertical path.
0030:     """
